<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>卷一礼集 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.160.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 15:08:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>顺医法：论气虚胃虚</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/ssml-shunyifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 15:05:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/ssml-shunyifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“顺医法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;气虚胃虚&lt;/strong&gt;之证治。核心思想是“&lt;strong&gt;顺其性而补之&lt;/strong&gt;”，即顺应脾胃喜温恶湿、胃气下行之性，以补气健脾、分消水湿为法。</description></item><item><title>反医法：论发狂见鬼 论发狂不见鬼 论中风堕地 论卒倒不知人。</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/ssml-fanyifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 14:50:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/ssml-fanyifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“反医法”部分，以天师（岐伯）、张公（张仲景）、华君（华佗）等人问答形式，论述&lt;strong&gt;发狂见鬼、发狂不见鬼、中风堕地、卒倒不知人&lt;/strong&gt;四症的病因病机及治法。核心观点是“&lt;strong&gt;邪之所凑，其气必虚&lt;/strong&gt;”，主张以&lt;strong&gt;大补元气为主，辅以祛痰祛邪&lt;/strong&gt;，即所谓“因其反而反治之”。</description></item><item><title>正医法：论肺经生痈 论久嗽服气法 论水泻论血痢 论水肿 论两胁胀满吞酸吐酸 论腰痛 论怔忡不寐</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/ssml-zhengyifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 10:50:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/ssml-zhengyifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本文为中医古籍《石室秘录》中“正医法”部分的节选，以岐天师（岐伯）、张公（张仲景）、雷公等问答形式，论述肺、脾、心、肝、肾诸经病症的病因及正治之法。</description></item></channel></rss>